Linux base for the SRNet exit-lease patch (prerequisite, apply FIRST).

Public upstream: https://github.com/session-foundation/session-router.git
Applies to:      afb98f959f4f7e0ef996aef02fa21a6caf26b1e9 (dev, "Merge pull request #59", v1.0.2-126)

Contents: exit-client RPCs (MapExit/UnmapExit/SwapExits with auth), map-only broker
check + wait for EXIT_CAPABLE, route poker fail-closed, plus MinGW/Windows build fixes
(all WIN32-guarded; no effect on Linux). Only src/, test/, CMakeLists.txt and
cmake/Version.cmake are touched. Submodule pins and .gitmodules are NOT changed:
all submodules stay at the public upstream commits recorded in afb98f959.
Known gap: the WIN32-only PRE_LINK hook calls contrib/windows-check-libzstd-coff.sh,
which this patch does not add; MinGW builds need that script. Linux builds are unaffected.
0001-exit-lease-admission-and-policy.patch applies cleanly on top of this.

